## Summerlin is more than a place to live — it’s a way of life.

Nestled against the Red Rock National Conservation Area and just minutes from the Las Vegas Strip, Summerlin is a top-selling master planned community where natural beauty, thoughtful design, and vibrant urban energy come together.

With more than 300 parks, over 200 miles of award-winning trails, and top-rated schools, Summerlin offers an unmatched lifestyle in Southern Nevada. Anchored by the highly coveted Downtown Summerlin, the community blends outdoor adventure, modern amenities, and everyday convenience.

Here, every moment feels elevated, and each day brings something new to discover.

